  "source_text": "When this card is Normal Summoned successfully, put 1 Spell Counter on it (max. 1). Increase the ATK of this card by 300 points for each Spell Counter on this card. Also, remove 1 Spell Counter from this card to destroy 1 Spell or Trap Card on the field.",
